@startuml SSD_UC004_Backward_Dust_To_Forward
hide footbox
title SSD - UC-004 후진 중 먼지 감지 후 전진 전환

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as System
actor "청소 장치" as Cleaner
actor "주행 장치" as Drive

Sensor -> System: reportSensorSnapshot(dustDetected=true, currentDirection=BACKWARD)
activate System
System -> Cleaner: setCleaningPower(BOOST)
System -> Drive: turnCounterClockwise90()

Sensor -> System: reportFrontObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected)

loop 전방 장애물 감지
    System -> Drive: turnCounterClockwise90()
    Sensor -> System: reportFrontObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected)
end

System -> Cleaner: setCleaningPower(NORMAL)
System -> Drive: moveForward()
note right of System: 진행 방향 = 전진

deactivate System
@enduml
